# Pindeck Project Structure

This file is the quick map of what exists in the repo today.

## Project Overview

Pindeck is an image curation app with:
- React + TypeScript frontend
- Convex backend (auth, data, storage, HTTP endpoints)
- Discord ingest/moderation bot (Bun process)
- AI analysis + variation generation pipeline

Current behavior highlights:
- Unified dark UI (`pd-theme`): Tweaks panel + `pindeck_tweaks` drive accent tokens via `src/lib/pdTheme.ts` (`--pd-accent*`, TMP `--accent*` mirrors); [`SignInForm`](src/SignInForm.tsx) shares the same variables.
- Discord imports are queued (`pending`) and manually approved/denied.
- Discord-origin generated children are also queued and keep lineage (`parentImageId`) and `sref`.
- Upload flow separates pending/processing/draft/active states.
- Sidebar (**Type / Genre / Style** + originals / sref filters) shares filter state with Gallery + Table via [`src/lib/libraryFilters.ts`](src/lib/libraryFilters.ts); aggregations from [`api.images.libraryAggregations`](convex/images/library.ts) (re-exported from [`convex/images/index.ts`](convex/images/index.ts)).
- VLM smart analysis fills `group`, `genre`, `shot`, `style` on `images` (see `convex/vision.ts`); Table **Backfill metadata** runs `enqueueCinematicMetadataBackfill` for the signed-in user’s uploads.
- **pd Gallery** ([`GalleryView`](src/components/pd/GalleryView.tsx)): sidebar filters + shared library state; aggregation Type/Genre/Style UI uses [`LibraryAggregationFilterParts.tsx`](src/components/pd/LibraryAggregationFilterParts.tsx); tiles are image-first (VAR badge for children); hover **like** + **bookmark → board** (`boards.addImage`); variation/generate in drawer, not on the card. **Create New Board** (`CreateBoardModal`) uses **pd-theme** fields. **Decks** tab: **`DeckView`** (`src/components/DeckView.tsx`) + **`src/components/deck/*`** (composer/canvas/section) — aligned with **`claude/redesign`**, not `pd/deck`; **library cards**: **16:9 hero** + per-slide **`PinSwatches`** from **`decks.list` `stripPalettes`** (**`images.colors`**, same as table rows). In **DeckComposer**, hero **five swatches** sample **`heroSampleUrl`**; Convex fallback via **`activeHeroDominantHexes`**; Tweaks **`--pd-accent*`** on composer chrome; **`BlockFrame`** no selection outline; composer edits **autosave via `decks.update`** (debounced Convex persistence).
- Table view ([`pd/TableView`](src/components/pd/TableView.tsx)): sortable columns, row selection, metadata/palette refresh; originals / sref filters via sidebar + [`libraryFilters`](src/lib/libraryFilters.ts). Parent/child lineage lives in [`ImageDetailDrawer`](src/components/pd/ImageDetailDrawer.tsx).
- App chrome: **Topbar** + **Sidebar** live in [`src/components/shell/`](src/components/shell/); view / filter / column state is in `useAppView`, `useLibraryFilterState`, and `useTableColumnVisibility`. `App.tsx` still owns auth, Convex subscriptions, tweaks, sidebar collapse, keyboard shortcuts, and view bodies.

